<p>Spawn tendrils of darkness to pursue a single target for up to 12 turns, leaving behind a trail of creeping darkness as they move. Targets seized by the tendrils are pinned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns and shrouded in darkness. The darkness deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> damage per turn to those within.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower. You do <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+5%, +9%, +12%, +15%, +17%</acronym> damage to anything that has entered your creeping dark.</p>